ce, summarize or inspect a Skill, use read instead. Copy a supplied ref, or pass task roots together. Use refresh:true only for a requested update; the supplied current or fixed main ref locates the same owner's latest version. Refresh roots with conflicting shared Requires together. Members remain candidates. Loading does not authorize executing a workflow. Notion consumption does not write to Notion.","name":"notion_use","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"ref":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"items":{"type":"string"},"maxItems":64,"minItems":1,"type":"array"}],"description":"Supplied sr:C/sr:S or skill://<stable-skill-id>[/<main>][?library=<root-page-uuid>] refs, or exact Notion Skill page URLs for task roots. Requires are included automatically. Copy returned canonical refs; names and aliases are discovery labels."},"refresh":{"description":"Explicitly adopt current versions for only these roots after a complete successful load. Existing Requires-only nodes cannot become independent roots through refresh; explicitly use them without refresh first. Accepts the supplied sr:C/sr:S or main ref unchanged, for example {ref:[REF_A,REF_B],refresh:true} for shared roots. Failure keeps the previous selection.","type":"boolean"}},"required":["ref"],"type":"object"}}]},"parentId":"e9f8cf0b","timestamp":"2026-11-26T13:32:18.608Z","type":"message"},{"id":"017df3fa","message":{"content":[{"text":"请按 松涛39 的现行规则为今天的包裹安排运输线路。包裹资料在 input/packages-1.json。请把每个 id 和 route 保存为 output/routes-1.json。","type":"text"}],"role":"user","timestamp":1795699938606},"parentId":"4dda73ba","timestamp":"2026-11-26T13:32:18.608Z","type":"message"},{"content":"<ntn-skills-guidance>\nLocal @Skills keep native availability. Honor explicit source and prior choice. Business Skills: equal same-name local/Notion fits: clarify; storage gives no priority. Clear fit/equivalent copies: no question. Editor flags grant no permissions.\nReuse complete content. Inspection never activates. Loadin